{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1b799658b25f886f","type":"group","x":-1100,"y":-620,"width":2220,"height":1249,"color":"3","label":"未命名组"},
		{"id":"a9d6d20573178880","type":"file","file":"方备份/ee8132d7-1a33-49cc-a985-8008dfb84e12 1.png","x":-1090,"y":-604,"width":400,"height":225},
		{
			"id":"bcf17da4aad89f7e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## 发现镣铐被换，高层大怒\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-605,
			"y":-560,
			"width":420,
			"height":137
		},
		{
			"id":"79c6ee42dedbb633",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"印在屏幕上 慢慢显现",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-830,
			"y":107,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"6228cf86bf4ea7e7","type":"file","file":"22d78b77-f49b-43a5-965c-6b185afbbe9f.png","x":-1090,"y":-293,"width":400,"height":225},
		{
			"id":"fb10c0d3222500e1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"搜查发现了更多的文稿，高层怒火中烧， 站起来拍桌子",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-570,
			"y":-211,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"2d57b4c4083ccf1a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"方被游行",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-570,
			"y":-25,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"de490697adc98d13",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"嗄！那矮矮的恶魔，拿出一把屠刀来了！做什么？呸！恶魔！你敢割我们母亲的肉？你想杀死她？咳哟！不好了！一刀！拍的一刀！好大胆的恶魔，居然向我们的母亲的左肩上砍下去！母亲的左臂，连着耳朵到颈，直到胸膛，都被砍下来了！砍下了身体的那么一大块——五分之一的那么一大块！母亲的血在涌流出来，她不能哭出声来，她的嘴唇只是在那里一张一张的动，她的眼泪和血在竞着涌流！朋友们！兄弟们！救救母亲呀！母亲快要死去了！",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-770,
			"y":437,
			"width":720,
			"height":168,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"989811f1168614e0","type":"file","file":"高家俊.png","x":-260,"y":-604,"width":400,"height":267},
		{
			"id":"930cc4842be1e1e6",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"方志敏传递给胡逸民 胡逸民看完眼神动容",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-180,
			"y":-293,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"e2a8243b8239738f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"方被转移",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-570,
			"y":191,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"efb9bc9c7042cc25",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"凌 被抓",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-525,
			"y":-371,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"a59da9c083706b5c","type":"file","file":"02_程全昭_三视图.png","x":150,"y":-604,"width":400,"height":267},
		{"id":"a661587215438a97","type":"file","file":"方备份/b728fb2a-6344-47cf-957c-4eef28ac2ed1.png","x":140,"y":5,"width":400,"height":225},
		{
			"id":"1d80661bce5682b5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"”随后1935年8月6日夜，他被秘密处决。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":590,
			"y":-453,
			"width":500,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"b47425e5fcd0595a","type":"file","file":"03_蒋介石_三视图 1.png","x":590,"y":191,"width":400,"height":267},
		{
			"id":"4b300ee5c5cdbba5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"夫妻找鲁迅",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-180,
			"y":281,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"43cc957c456677f1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## SCENE 1：蒋介石当面劝降\n押送南昌\n**画面：**\n优待室。桌上摆茶和水果。蒋坐对面，语气不怒自威。\n方志敏坐对面，瘦削但腰背挺直。\n\n蒋介石劝降：只要一封声名信。\n方志敏：喝茶 闭眼。\n转头\n镜头远景，夕阳无限好，美丽风景，展示民国城市风光\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":660,
			"y":-272,
			"width":260,
			"height":409
		},
		{
			"id":"c26ada92faf9b61f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"程转移给夫妻",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-190,
			"y":107,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"4218229ad99cdf0a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"胡传给高女友程",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-180,
			"y":-67,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{"id":"b92fc0e39565108e","type":"file","file":"699df4cf-8431-4a4e-94f5-0cd93afc980b.png","x":150,"y":260,"width":400,"height":225},
		{"id":"db6c81cdebf2cfc7","type":"file","file":"方备份/b7c8e6eb-8af1-4587-99e9-9613636b86d9.png","x":150,"y":-263,"width":400,"height":225},
		{
			"id":"93dbe5cb1982658b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"  高被定紧",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-180,
			"y":-211,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		}
	],
